---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Work — Ayush Hardeniya"
  description="Open source contributions, projects, and things I'm building."
>
  <h1>Work</h1>

  <section class="section first">
    <h2>open source</h2>

    <p>
      <strong>Debian / debusine</strong> — 20+ merged MRs
      <br />
      <span class="small">
        Contributor to Debusine, Debian's software factory platform. My
        contributions cover workflow execution, artifact handling, validation,
        CLI behaviour, HTTP timeouts, and other fixes across the codebase.
      </span>
      <span class="stack">Python · Django · PostgreSQL · GitLab CI</span>
      <span class="small">
        <a href="https://salsa.debian.org/freexian-team/debusine/-/merge_requests/?scope=all&state=merged&author_username=ayushhardeniya">
          contributions</a>
        · <a href="https://salsa.debian.org/ayushHardeniya">salsa</a>
      </span>
    </p>

    <p>
      <strong>Jenkins</strong>
      <br />
      <span class="small">
        Contributor to Jenkins, mainly around its documentation tooling and site
        infrastructure. Worked on the ongoing retooling of the Jenkins
        documentation sites.
      </span>
      <span class="stack">Java · Antora · Vite · Node.js</span>

      <span class="small">
        <a href="https://github.com/jenkins-infra/jenkins.io/pulls?q=is%3Apr+author%3AayushHardeniya+">
          contributions</a>
      </span>
    </p>
    <p class="small">
      <a href="https://github.com/ayushHardeniya/#other-open-source">
        view all →
      </a>
    </p>
