    <h2>projects</h2>

    <p>
      <strong>careers-engine</strong> —<span class="small muted">[active]</span>
      <br />
      <span class="small">
        An open-source backend for discovering and organizing software
        engineering opportunities. It collects listings, normalizes the data,
        and publishes relevant jobs through automated workflows.
      </span>
      <span class="stack">Python · GitHub Actions · Discord</span>
      <span class="small">
        <a href="https://github.com/ZenYukti/careers-engine">github</a> ·
        <a href="https://careers-engine.zenyukti.in">docs</a>
      </span>
    </p>

    <p>
      <strong>EnerFabric</strong>
      <br />
      <span class="small">
        An intent-driven coordination platform for distributed energy resources.
        Assets publish what they need or can provide, and a policy-driven layer
        coordinates those intents.
      </span>
      <span class="stack">Next.js · FastAPI · PostgreSQL · MQTT · Docker</span>

      <span class="small">
        <a href="https://github.com/ayushHardeniya/EnerFabric">github</a> ·
        <a href="http://13.49.41.89/">live</a>
      </span>
    </p>

    <p class="small">
      <a href="https://github.com/ayushHardeniya?tab=repositories">view all →</a>
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>community</h2>

    <p>
      <strong>ZenYukti</strong> — founder
      <br />
      <span class="small">
        Started in my first year of college as a place to build and learn
        together. It has grown into a broader student-led platform around open
        source, projects, events, and developer collaboration, with 1400+
        members.
      </span>
      <br />
      <span class="small">
        <a href="https://github.com/ZenYukti">github</a> ·
